ContractStability.Class:
Contract may change incompatibly between minor/pre-1.0 platform revisions.

Compatibility guarantee:
  - exact supported range only;
  - no N-2 promise;
  - incompatibility MUST still be detected before activation.

Contract follows explicit semantic compatibility rules.

Compatibility guarantee:
  - supported stable major lines have defined negotiation;
  - compatible minor evolution MUST NOT require consumer rewrite;
  - breaking semantic change requires new major.

MigrationOnCopy.Requirement:
Migration provenance records:
  - source revision;
  - target revision;
  - source schema;
  - target schema;
  - migration path;
  - result.

Rollback.Requirement:
Rollback restores:
  - package revision;
  - compatible state snapshot/copy;
  - composition selection metadata.
